WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.340
The Banana Lounge is a space on campus that&nbsp;
students can grab a banana, grab a drink,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.260
they can study, they can rest. It's basically&nbsp;
a space that is meant to bring people together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.640
people in the MIT community
[Music] I'm Megan Lim and I am&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:20.160
currently logistics lead of Banana Lounge. My team&nbsp;
works on a lot of the operational side of things,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:26.100
so there's ordering the bananas, there's ordering&nbsp;
of the drinks and all the other consumables.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.940
Just yesterday we went through 53 banana boxes&nbsp;
and each banana box has about 100 banana fingers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.080
Right now it's being funded by UA and&nbsp;
alumni donors, which we really appreciate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:41.160
The volunteers care about the space a&nbsp;
lot and also care about helping others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:48.360
Why bananas? There's quite a lot of good&nbsp;
reasons, it's very, something light hearted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.260
that we appreciate and that hopefully&nbsp;
the MIT community appreciates as well

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:59.160
I heard about the Banana Lounge before I even&nbsp;
stepped foot on campus. Every time I step in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.520
the space like there's usually at least one&nbsp;
person, especially during the busy hours,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:07.080
there's like people, someone you know like hey,&nbsp;
haven't seen you in a while, or what are you doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:12.960
here again at 2am in the morning? I think it's&nbsp;
really important that it's student run, like no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:17.100
one knows students better than students and that's&nbsp;
what makes the place really unique to me because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:23.160
like people that benefit it is people like myself,&nbsp;
people who struggle with psets, people who are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:30.180
just looking for a community. Students are active&nbsp;
all times of day, and if students need a space to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:34.740
grab a banana, grab a drink or like a pick-me-up,&nbsp;
then that's what we want to be for them. It will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.720
be open 24/7. Sometimes at 2am you need food&nbsp;
and Banana Lounge will be there for you. There's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:44.820
a wide variety of people at MIT and Banana Lounge&nbsp;
wants to support those people. They want to study&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:49.620
late at night, let them study late at night, they&nbsp;
want to play with Legos late at night, let them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.420
I see someone walking around with&nbsp;
a banana I know that that person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.340
just visited Banana Lounge, and it makes me smile

